---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { photos } from '../data/photos';

const crumbs = {
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: site.url },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'About us', item: `${site.url}/about` },
  ],
};
---

<Base
  title="About us"
  description="Simon Hewitt runs White City Decorating Contractors from Sandy. He paints and decorates homes, and customers on Google call him back."
  image="/work/08.webp"
  schemas={[crumbs]}
>
  <Fragment slot="hero">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / About us</p>
    <h1>About us</h1>
  </Fragment>

  <section class="band prose">
    <Photo photo={photos[7]} eager sizes="(min-width: 760px) 640px, 100vw" />
    <h2>Simon Hewitt, painter and decorator</h2>
    <p>
      White City Decorating Contractors is Simon Hewitt’s painting and decorating business.
      He is based at {site.address.street}, {site.address.locality}, {site.address.postcode}.
      He works in your home. That address is not a shop, and there is no showroom to walk into.
    </p>
    <p>
      Google lists the business as a painter. The Facebook page says the same thing in plain words:
      professional painting and decorating. Simon does the work himself.
    </p>
    <h2>How the jobs go</h2>
    <p>
      People who have used him talk about the same things. He turns up when he says he will.
      He protects the floors. He prepares the surface before he paints it. If old paint is
      loose, he deals with that first. A tin of Zinsser Peel Stop shows up in the job photos
      for that reason.
    </p>
    <p>
      He uses spray equipment on doors, wardrobes and kitchen units when a brush would leave
      more marks. Helen King, a Google reviewer, wrote that the spray finish is smooth and
      that the preparation is what makes it so. He also gives colour advice and will say
      which paint fits the room.
    </p>
    <p>
      He keeps the house usable while he works, and he leaves the room tidy. Rob Shirley
      had a whole house done after an extension, then called him back years later for the
      lounge and kitchen. Other reviews say the same: people ask him back.
    </p>
    <h2>Hours</h2>
    <p>
      Monday to Friday, 8am to 5pm. Saturday, 8am to 12:30pm. Sunday, closed.
      If you need a price, call {site.phoneDisplay} or email {site.email}.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/contact">Go to the contact page</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
